{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>The sons of Jefeth: Gomer</b> etc. <b>And the sons of Yavan</b> etc. The reason Scripture did not list the sons of Magog and Madai and Tuval and Meshekh and Tiras is that no heads of nations emerged from them, and each of them was designated only as a single nation. And so you may explain regarding Put son of Ham, and regarding Elam and Asshur and Lud, sons of Shem."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:41.437462355Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}